WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Terry cancels crouching medium kick into Drive Rush.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.440
Light Power Wave and raw Drive Rush carry the juggle toward the corner.

3
00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:08.080
Power Geyser connects after medium Power Charge.

4
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.500
Terry spends both punch-button continuations.

5
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.200
The route finishes with Terry in burnout and no Super remaining.
